WEBVTT

00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:25.372
KaamSet gives an Indian merchant ready AI teammates. Choose English, Hindi

00:00:25.372 --> 00:00:30.394
or Hinglish, describe the business, and review its facts and images.

00:00:30.394 --> 00:00:35.416
This prepared store includes downloadable fictional records. Customer channels and payments

00:00:35.416 --> 00:00:40.437
are simulated; the models, cloud workers and saved application results are

00:00:40.437 --> 00:00:40.894
real.

00:00:45.350 --> 00:00:49.564
Start Milan on the accepted cafe invoice. He reads the outstanding

00:00:49.564 --> 00:00:53.779
balance, prepares a collection reply and creates a payment request for

00:00:53.779 --> 00:00:57.993
two thousand four hundred and eighty rupees. The owner can inspect

00:00:57.993 --> 00:01:02.208
the invoice and saved action evidence. The customer payment shown in

00:01:02.208 --> 00:01:04.123
Merchant Lab is explicitly simulated.

00:01:10.350 --> 00:01:14.870
Business memory connects the catalogue, invoice, payment and customer. Source excerpts

00:01:14.870 --> 00:01:19.390
let the owner check an answer. Naina distinguishes a successful collection

00:01:19.390 --> 00:01:23.911
from an unsettled payout, flags the exception and avoids sending another

00:01:23.911 --> 00:01:28.431
reminder. Private record tools propose a change before writing. The owner

00:01:28.431 --> 00:01:32.951
reviews the exact difference and exports the updated file. Imported history

00:01:32.951 --> 00:01:35.417
is never treated as bank verification.

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:44.510
Approved work runs on the server. On October fifth, we started

00:01:44.510 --> 00:01:48.670
Milan, confirmed that the cloud worker was reading the records, and

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:52.830
closed the merchant tab. When we reopened it, his completed result

00:01:52.830 --> 00:01:56.990
and source receipt were saved. This evidence walkthrough compresses waits and

00:01:56.990 --> 00:02:01.150
shows recorded screens; it does not animate fabricated successes. Jobs can

00:02:01.150 --> 00:02:05.310
still wait for an owner decision, account permission or provider availability.

00:02:15.350 --> 00:02:20.067
Vijay coordinates the website team. The owner supplies approved images and

00:02:20.067 --> 00:02:24.784
business facts. The team reviews assets, prepares design and copy, and

00:02:24.784 --> 00:02:29.500
validates the result. A published KaamSet business link opens independently of

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:32.502
the merchant workspace, with no login required.

00:02:35.350 --> 00:02:39.972
The architecture combines React, a TypeScript API, PostgreSQL and Bull M

00:02:39.972 --> 00:02:44.594
Q workers. Cognee provides scoped source memory; Sarvam supports Indian speech;

00:02:44.594 --> 00:02:49.216
Composio connects supported apps. Smaller models, bounded retrieval and saved stages

00:02:49.216 --> 00:02:53.838
control usage. Nine ninety nine, twenty nine ninety nine and seventy

00:02:53.838 --> 00:02:58.460
nine ninety nine rupees are proposed monthly plans for paid pilot

00:02:58.460 --> 00:02:58.881
validation.
